# A /reconnect after a long stable session starts backoff from the bottom:
# the 60 s reset applies even though the link ends from Quitting.
! connect
> dial #1 irc.test:6667 plain
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
! opened
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :irc.test 001 textual :Welcome
@ +10s
! closed eof
? notice Disconnected: the server closed the connection; reconnecting in 5 s
? failures 1
@ wake
> dial #2 irc.test:6667 plain
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
! opened
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :irc.test 001 textual :Welcome
@ +61s
! disconnect Reconnecting
> QUIT Reconnecting
! connect
< ERROR :Closing Link: textual (Quit: Reconnecting)
> hangup #2
> dial #3 irc.test:6667 plain
? notice Disconnected: quit
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
? failures 0
! closed error connection refused
? notice Disconnected: connection refused; reconnecting in 5 s
? failures 1
? waiting 4.965s
